---
// src/components/MemoryGrid.astro
---

<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 my-6">
  {/* 1. Session Memory Card */}
  <div
    class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50 shadow-sm"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">
        Session Memory
      </h4>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      현재 세션이 끝나면 사라질 수 있는 휘발성 컨텍스트입니다.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {
        ['현재 채팅', '현재 Context Window', '현재 Agent Runtime'].map(
          (item) => (
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
              {item}
            </span>
          )
        )
      }
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* 2. Project Memory Card */}
  <div
    class="flex flex-col p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 shadow-md"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">
        Project Memory
      </h4>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Git과 마크다운 문서로 영구히 보존되는 프로젝트의 핵심 기억입니다.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {
        [
          'Git',
          'PRODUCT_SPEC.md',
          'ARCHITECTURE.md',
          'TASKS.md',
          'AGENTS.md',
        ].map((item) => (
          <span
            class={`inline-block px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg border ${
              item.endsWith('.md')
                ? 'bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 border-slate-800 font-mono'
                : 'bg-white text-slate-900 border-transparent'
            } shadow-sm`}
          >
            {item}
          </span>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
